WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:01.370
Do you remember Cat Clicker?

00:00:01.370 --> 00:00:04.510
Do you remember the pain on Andy's face as the project

00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:07.600
requirements changed again, and again, and again?

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:10.840
I remember it very well.

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:11.400
Poor Andy.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:13.620
Well, a, anyway.

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:15.630
Our final version has two main areas.

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:17.760
It's going to have a list of cats, and

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:21.410
a cat detail area, where you can click on the currently selected cat.

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:24.280
Well as it turns out, the last few lessons have gotten us ready to

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:27.780
build Cat Clicker, and this time we'll build it right.

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:29.960
Now, I'll tell you from personal experience.

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:33.350
Even though, I've built a lot of applications and structures with wood, too, for

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:36.740
that matter, one thing I hate doing, is planning.

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:40.460
But every time I don't plan things out, they end up taking much more time.

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:42.970
And by the end, I wish I'd spent the extra time to plan.

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:45.420
So, let's take some time and plan this out.

